["The first action, at least 12 hours after the first action, that contacts a host no earlier action named.",
"The first action the pack labels search_for_secrets. A pack without that intent never fires it.",
"The first hour with more distinct named actors than the mean plus 3 standard deviations of every earlier hour (at least 12 earlier hours). Known at the end of that hour.",
